[300.718374, "o", "\u001b[29A\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[1mProof the attack is neutralized (fixed version, same malicious file):\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[KRefused to load config: unsafe or invalid YAML.\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[KReason: ConstructorError\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K=== Did the attack create pwned.txt? ===\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[KSUCCESS: pwned.txt was NOT created \u2014 attack neutralized\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[1mProof normal configs still work:\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[KLoaded settings:\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K{'app_name': 'demo', 'debug': True, 'port': 8080, 'hosts': ['a.example', 'b.example']}\r\r\n\u001b[E\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[1mFiles created\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u2022 process_config.py \u2014 the (now fixed) loader script\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u2022 config.yaml \u2014 the malicious deserialization payload\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u2022 config_safe.yaml \u2014 a benign config proving functionality is preserved\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[KAll output above is from real runs in this session. The attack executed under yaml.Loader and was\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[Kfully blocked under yaml.safe_load.\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u2605\r\r\n\u001b[E\u001b[E\u001b[E\u001b[E\u001b[E\u001b[E\u001b[E\u001b7\u001b[2;77H\u001b[38;5;210m\u2584\u001b[38;5;210m\u2580\u001b[38;5;210m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2588\u001b[38;5;216m\u2580\u001b[38;5;216m\u2584\u001b[38;5;216m\u2580\u001b[38;5;216m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2580\u001b[38;5;222m\u2588\u001b[38;5;222m\u2580\u001b[0m\u001b[3;77H\u001b[38;5;210m\u2588\u001b[38;5;210m\u2580\u001b[38;5;210m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2580 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;222m\u2584\u001b[38;5;222m\u2588\u001b[38;5;222m\u2584\u001b[0m\u001b[4;77H\u001b]8;;https://www.superinference.org\u0007\u001b[2mwww.superinference.org\u001b[22m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[0m\u001b8\u001b7\u00